# Semantic-index exclusions (#5), layered on SocratiCode's built-in defaults and
# .gitignore. Pinned by tests/test_socraticode_config.py; governs the code index and
# graph only, never the context artifacts (docs/SOCRATICODE.md).

# Vendored gregoryfoster/skills and obra/superpowers. skills/ and .claude/skills/ are
# symlinks into skills-vendor/, bar skills/brainstorming, an upstream copy with one
# path changed (docs/SKILLS.md); .skills/ holds the installed doctor.sh. Unexcluded
# they outnumber processor's own files, and every sibling's includeLinked search
# would serve them as processor.
skills-vendor/
skills/
.claude/skills/
.skills/

# Worktrees: using-git-worktrees' root and the harness's, both inside this tree.
.worktrees/
.claude/worktrees/

# The cannobserv wheelhouse (already git-ignored; built wheels, never source). No
# trailing slash: a worktree links it, and a symlink is not a directory.
.wheelhouse

# Dated prose. Searchable as the implementation-plans context artifact; out of the
# code index so a superseded plan cannot outrank the source it describes.
docs/plans/
